        "q1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know which Kérastase shampoo is best for me?",
            "content": "<p>Begin by naming your single foremost concern. Hair fall → Genesis. Dryness → Nutritive. Dullness → Elixir Ultime. Frizz → Gloss Absolu (fine) or Discipline (thick). Color fade → Chroma Absolu; brassiness on blonde → Blond Absolu Purple Shampoo. Dandruff → Symbiose. Thinning → Densifique. Breakage from bleach or rebond → Résistance or Première. If you genuinely cannot decide, Gloss Absolu is the most universal place to begin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Kérastase shampoo sulfate-free?",
            "content": "<p>Not every formula, but several are. Both <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-chroma-absolu-sulfate-free-shampoo-thin-hair\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Chroma Absolu Sulfate-Free Hydrating Protective Shampoo (Thin Hair) at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Chroma Absolu protective shampoos</a> are sulfate-free, the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-discipline-fluidealiste-shampoo-250ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Discipline Fluidealiste Sulfate-Free Shampoo 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Discipline Fluidealiste</a> carries sulfate-free in its name, and the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-symbiose-purifying-anti-dandruff-shampoo\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Symbiose Purifying Anti-Dandruff Shampoo 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Symbiose anti-dandruff shampoo</a> is silicone- and sulfate-free. \"Sulfate-free\" at Kérastase means free of harsh SLS and SLES; gentler surfactants may remain, so it is best understood as \"free of harsh sulfates\" rather than free of all cleansing agents. HairMNL keeps them together in a <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-sulfate-free-shampoos\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Sulfate-Free Shampoos at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">sulfate-free Kérastase collection</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Kérastase shampoo on rebonded or keratin-treated hair?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — several are well suited to chemically-treated hair. Discipline (Fluidealiste or Oléo-Relax) maintains smoothness, Genesis reduces the breakage common after rebonding, and the Chroma Absolu sulfate-free shampoos are the choice if the hair is also colored. One rule: avoid clarifying or deep-cleansing shampoos for the first two weeks after a treatment, so the result is not stripped early.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between Kérastase Genesis and Densifique?",
            "content": "<p>Genesis addresses hair fall caused by breakage — it strengthens individual strands so they stop snapping. Densifique addresses hair that looks thin or lacks density — it plumps the fiber for fuller-looking hair. If hair is actively falling, begin with Genesis; if it has always been fine and you want more body, Densifique is the better fit. Many use the two in rotation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I buy authentic Kérastase shampoo in the Philippines?",
            "content": "<p>HairMNL is an authorized Kérastase retailer with more than 160 authentic products online at hairmnl.com, delivered nationwide, with physical access at the Kapitolyo and Serendra stores. Counterfeit Kérastase does circulate locally, so purchasing from an authorized retailer is the only way to be certain your bottle is the genuine formula. Browse the full <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-shampoo\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Shampoos at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kérastase Shampoos collection</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
